  "item_short_desc": "<p>Combat the cold with Rothco&rsquo;s Spec Ops Tactical Fleece Jacket. Tackle tough terrains and cold climates with our ruggedly reliable jackets. The tactical jacket keeps your body warm and comfortable in a variety of environments, and is great for military personnel, outdoor enthusiasts, everyday use, and more.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "3054",
  "description": "<p>Combat the cold with Rothco&rsquo;s Spec Ops Tactical Fleece Jacket. Tackle tough terrains and cold climates with our ruggedly reliable jackets. The tactical jacket keeps your body warm and comfortable in a variety of environments, and is great for military personnel, outdoor enthusiasts, everyday use, and more. Dependable and Capable Construction: Each tactical ops jacket provides consistent thermal insulation and warmth with a heavyweight fleece composition and tricot lining. The reinforced shoulder and forearm yokes enhance the jacket&rsquo;s durability and performance. Along with the mandarin collar for added coverage and protection, these jackets also feature an internal main zipper flap. 7 Multifunctional Pockets: With utility at the forefront, these capable fleece jackets contain a variety of pockets: 2 shoulder pockets, left chest pocket, 2 front slash pockets, and 2 interior drop pockets for concealment. The chest pocket has an opening for wired headphones, where you can store and connect your audio devices or phone all inside your jacket. Shoulder Pockets with Loop Field: The shoulder, chest, and slash pockets utilize zippers to better secure your everyday carry items. In addition to the full zip closure for extra storage, the shoulder pockets also consist of a 3 &frac34;&rdquo; square loop field for flag, morale, and unit patches. Additional Features: The foldout cuffs keep your sleeves in place as the built-in thumbholes preserve your hands&rsquo; heat without sacrificing mobility and range of motion. Our heavyweight fleece jackets also include a drawstring waist for a comfortable and adjustable fit that helps block wind and cold weather.</p>",
